<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Verification Worksheet</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
        .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .header-info div { width: 45%; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="UT Dallas Logo" style="height: 60px;">
        </div>
        <div class="header-info">
            <div>
                <h2 style="margin: 0;">Office of Financial Aid</h2>
                <p style="margin: 2px 0;">800 W Campbell Rd ROC22 Richardson, TX 75080</p>
                <p style="margin: 2px 0;">972-883-2941 | ph | 972-883-6803 fax</p>
                <p style="margin: 2px 0;">financial-aid@utdallas.edu</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">2020-2021 VERIFICATION WORKSHEET</h1>
        <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">Parent Additional Financial Information</h2>
        <p style="text-align: justify; margin-top: 15px;">Use your parents' additional financial information for 2018 to complete the following worksheet. If any item does not apply, please enter "N/A" for Not Applicable.</p>
        <p style="text-align: justify; margin-top: 10px;">Once we have received all requested documents on your To Do List, please allow our office up to 3 weeks to review and process the documents submitted.</p>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Student Information</h3>
        <table style="width: 50%;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Name (Last, First, Middle Initial)</td>
                <td><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>UTD ID</td>
                <td><span data-field="student_id">{{ student_id }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Child Support Paid</h3>
        <p>List the amount of child support your parent(s) paid in 2018. Do not include child support paid for the children already included in your parents' household size.</p>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 25%;">Name of Person Who Paid Support</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%;">Name of Person Who Received Support Payments</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%;">Name of Child For Whom Support was Paid</th>
                    <th style="width: 15%;">Age of Child</th>
                    <th style="width: 10%;">Total Amount Paid in 2018</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for item in child_support_payments %}
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].payer_name">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].payer_name }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].recipient_name">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].recipient_name }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].child_name">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].child_name }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].child_age">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].child_age }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].amount }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Taxable Earnings from Need-Based Employment Programs</h3>
        <p>List your parents' 2018 taxable earnings from Federal Work-Study and/or other need-based employment programs. Also include need-based employment portions of fellowships and assistantships.</p>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 50%;">Source of Income</th>
                    <th style="width: 50%;">Total Amount Received in 2018</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for item in taxable_earnings %}
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="taxable_earnings[{{ loop.index0 }}].source">{{ taxable_earnings[loop.index0].source }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="taxable_earnings[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ taxable_earnings[loop.index0].amount }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Taxable Grant and Scholarship Aid</h3>
        <p>List the amount of taxable college grant and scholarship aid reported on your parents' 2018 tax return. This amount can be found on the 2018 tax return, listed with the notation "SCH" beside line 1 of the 1040.</p>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 50%;">Type of Aid</th>
                    <th style="width: 50%;">Total Amount Reported as "SCH" on the 2018 Tax Return</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for item in grant_scholarship_aid %}
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="grant_scholarship_aid[{{ loop.index0 }}].aid_type">{{ grant_scholarship_aid[loop.index0].aid_type }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="grant_scholarship_aid[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ grant_scholarship_aid[loop.index0].amount }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <p style="font-size: 10px; margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">With few exceptions, you are entitled on your request to be informed about the information UTD collects about you. Under Sections 552.021and 552.023 of the Texas Government Code, you are entitled to receive and review the information. Under Section 559.004 of the Texas Government Code, you are entitled to have UTD correct information about you that is held by us and that is incorrect.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="UT Dallas Logo" style="height: 60px;">
        </div>
        <div class="header-info">
            <div>
                <h2 style="margin: 0;">Office of Financial Aid</h2>
                <p style="margin: 2px 0;">800 W Campbell Rd ROC22 Richardson, TX 75080</p>
                <p style="margin: 2px 0;">972-883-2941 | ph | 972-883-6803 fax</p>
                <p style="margin: 2px 0;">financial-aid@utdallas.edu</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <p>UTD ID: <span data-field="student_id_page2">{{ student_id_page2 }}</span></p>
            <p>STUDENT'S NAME: <span data-field="full_name_page2">{{ full_name_page2 }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Combat Pay</h3>
        <p>List the amount of combat pay or special combat pay reported by your parent(s) on their 2018 tax return as part of the adjusted gross income. Don't include untaxed combat pay.</p>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 50%;">Source of Income</th>
                    <th style="width: 50%;">Total Amount Received in 2018</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for item in combat_pay %}
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="combat_pay[{{ loop.index0 }}].source">{{ combat_pay[loop.index0].source }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="combat_pay[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ combat_pay[loop.index0].amount }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Cooperative Education Earnings</h3>
        <p>List the amount of your parents' 2018 earnings from work under a cooperative education program offered by a college.</p>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 50%;">Source of Income</th>
                    <th style="width: 50%;">Total Amount Received in 2018</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for item in co_op_earnings %}
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="co_op_earnings[{{ loop.index0 }}].source">{{ co_op_earnings[loop.index0].source }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="co_op_earnings[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ co_op_earnings[loop.index0].amount }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Signature and Certification</h3>
        <p>Each person signing this worksheet certifies that all of the information provided above is complete and correct.</p>
        <table style="width: 100%;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 50%;">Student Signature _________________________</td>
                <td style="width: 50%;">Date _________________________</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 50%;">Parent Signature _________________________</td>
                <td style="width: 50%;">Date _________________________</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Please submit the completed worksheet with handwritten (not typed) signatures to the Office of Financial Aid by:</p>
        <p style="font-size: 12px;">Email: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span> or Fax: 972-883-6803 or In-person drop-off: Student Services Building, first floor</p>

        <p style="font-size: 10px; margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">With few exceptions, you are entitled on your request to be informed about the information UTD collects about you. Under Sections 552.021and 552.023 of the Texas Government Code, you are entitled to receive and review the information. Under Section 559.004 of the Texas Government Code, you are entitled to have UTD correct information about you that is held by us and that is incorrect.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>